# Work Credit RAG — always-on context

Umbrella repo: `Work_Credit-RAG_Phase1`. Production code lives in **submodules**; parent owns pins, `deploy/`, `eval/`, contracts.

## Ownership (edit in the owning repo)

| Path | Repo | Owns |
|---|---|---|
| `components/knowledgebase` | Work_RAG-KB `master` | ingest, hybrid retrieval, entity lists |
| `components/orchestrator` | Work_RAG-Orchestrator `main` | LangGraph graph, OpenAI chat API `:8100` |
| `components/guardrails` | Work_RAG-Guardrails `main` | Persian rails + guarded Gemma `:8200` |
| `components/server-setup` | Work_RAG-Server-Setup `main` | H200/Vast infra, manager `:9000`, embeds |
| `components/tracing` | parent | fallback collector `:3000` |
| `agent-state/` | ICS_ChatBot_agent-state | agent mission, todos, history, standards |

Do **not** duplicate component implementation in the parent. Component fix → commit in submodule → advance parent gitlink.

