## Never do

- `pkill python` — use `bash deploy/vast/stop.sh`
- Force-push; commit `.env` / secrets / `*.npz` / logs / venvs
- Expose Gemma `:18000`, postgres, or redis publicly
- Set only one of `HF_HOME` / `HF_HUB_CACHE`
- Omit `request_id` in Studio run inputs
- Mix `asyncio.to_thread` with asyncpg (breaks pool)

## Git

- `main`/`master` = production; `develop` = integration; work on `feature/*` → PR → develop
- Conventional commits: `feat:`, `fix:`, `docs:`, `chore:`
